    "mnemonic": "Another way to say <vocabulary>to shut</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>to close</vocabulary>. A verb version of the kanji <ja>閉</ja>.",
    "readingMnemonic": "The reading is different from, say, <ja>閉める</ja> or <ja>しまる</ja>. Instead, the reading is <ja>とじる</ja>. Why? Because you shut your <reading>toe</reading> (<ja>と</ja>) in the door because it sheared off the hinges and was out of control."
